    {
      "work_id": 1372,
      "language": "en",
      "bound_author_id": 157,
      "text": "A decade after leading a revolution, Darrow still faces a war that refuses to end. The society he helped overturn has left a fragile new order, and another dangerous mission threatens everything he hoped to protect. Elsewhere, a young refugee, a grieving former soldier and an heir seeking revenge confront the consequences of that struggle. Their paths broaden the story beyond Darrow as the promises of liberation collide with the costs of continuing conflict.",
