    {
      "work_id": 4864,
      "language": "en",
      "bound_author_id": 2537,
      "text": "Lena has escaped a society that treats love as an illness, but freedom brings loss and unfamiliar dangers. Separated from Alex, she finds shelter among people resisting the authorities and begins to take part in their struggle. The second Delirium novel follows her efforts to survive beyond the world she knew and to find a place within the resistance. Her grief and new relationships complicate the choices she faces as that conflict draws her further in.",
